scenario: aborted-transaction
A         failing statement inside the transaction                                             error 22012
A         SET ROLE, SET search_path, BEGIN, insert (no COMMIT or ROLLBACK)                     done
A         release()                                                                            returned
B         same physical session as A                                                           true
observer  B's backend at checkout, before B's first statement                                  idle in transaction (aborted)
B         first statement                                                                      error 25P02
observer  where B's insert is visible                                                          not visible
observer  A's insert                                                                           not visible
observer  A's insert after pool.end() closed the connection                                    not visible
